# Ruta 3 (C2, contract 31), 24x40. column = i, row = j. Pueblo Cantera arrives at the south end (j = 39, from its EAST exit), the Monte Eco cave is the north end (j = 0).
# Look (the user's variant A of tools/c2_mock.py): a MOUNTAIN TRAIL of dry packed earth (bg 0), the trail with two ruts, rock slopes instead of trees along both sides, wooden
# post fences, dry bushes, scree and boulders, a cairn at the start / middle / top, trainers on their dotted stone spots (5, they look down the trail: the left ones face S,
# the right ones face W, range 3, so a beaten trainer never closes the 2-wide trail), dry-grass patches (tall grass: C_GRASS, wild table below), a Ward Spray and an Antidote in the side nooks.
# Memory: see the table in section 31 (contract 31).
@map ruta_3
@size 24 40
@interior no
@area ruta_3
@bg 0
@fill earth
@spawn south 11 38 N            # arriving from Pueblo Cantera
@spawn north 10 1 S            # arriving from the Monte Eco cave
@encounters grass rate=20      # Route 3 flavour: the birds, the songbird, the song cloud, the needle hedgehog, the common rodent
  jabbird 7 11 25
  flitter 7 10 20
  quillix 7 10 15
  quillia 7 10 15
  lullabun 6 10 15
  muncrit 7 10 10
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, normal route): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 4 (4/256 per step).
@open_rate 4
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=earth                    # dry packed earth (4 variants)
  =  tile=mtrail                   # the trail (2 variants)
  g  tile=scrub                    # dry brush: the tall grass of the mountain
  S  tile=earth object=slope       # rock slopes (3 variants): the border of the route, two cells deep
  _  tile=none                     # nothing beyond the slopes (white)
  b  tile=earth object=dry_bush
  r  tile=earth object=rock
  B  tile=earth object=boulder
  s  tile=earth object=scree       # loose stones (decoration, walkable)
  c  tile=earth object=cairn
  f  tile=earth object=rfence_j
  G  tile=earth object=sign interact=look text=ruta3.sign
  n  tile=mtrail
  d  tile=mtrail
  i  tile=earth item=ward_spray
  j  tile=earth item=antidote
  1  tile=trainer_spot npc=explorador id=t1 face=W trainer=explorador_r3a range=3 text=tr.explorador_r3a.pre after=tr.explorador_r3a.after
  2  tile=trainer_spot npc=chica id=t2 face=S trainer=chica_r3 range=3 text=tr.chica_r3.pre after=tr.chica_r3.after
  3  tile=trainer_spot npc=cazabichos id=t3 face=W trainer=cazabichos_r3 range=3 text=tr.cazabichos_r3.pre after=tr.cazabichos_r3.after
  4  tile=trainer_spot npc=montanista id=t4 face=S trainer=montanista_r3 range=3 text=tr.montanista_r3.pre after=tr.montanista_r3.after
  5  tile=trainer_spot npc=explorador id=t5 face=W trainer=explorador_r3b range=3 text=tr.explorador_r3b.pre after=tr.explorador_r3b.after
  H  tile=earth hidden=rich_salve   # F2 (contract 74): a hidden item
